    {
      "source": "The <code>@Document</code> annotation has an argument <code>createIndex</code>.\nIf this argument is set to true - which is the default value - Spring Data Elasticsearch will during bootstrapping the repository support on application startup check if the index defined by the <code>@Document</code> annotation exists.",
      "translation": "@Document 注解有一个参数 createIndex。如果将该参数设置为 true（默认值），则在应用程序启动期间，Spring Data Elasticsearch 会在引导仓库支持时检查由 @Document 注解定义的索引是否存在。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If it does not exist, the index will be created and the mappings derived from the entity’s annotations (see <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../object-mapping.html\">Elasticsearch Object Mapping</a>) will be written to the newly created index.\nDetails of the index that will be created can be set by using the <code>@Setting</code> annotation, refer to <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../misc.html#elasticsearc.misc.index.settings\">Index settings</a> for further information.",
      "translation": "如果索引不存在，将创建该索引，并根据实体上的注解（参见<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../object-mapping.html\">Elasticsearch 对象映射</a>）生成的映射写入新创建的索引。  \n可以使用<code>@Setting</code>注解设置将要创建的索引的详细信息，有关更多信息请参阅<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../misc.html#elasticsearc.misc.index.settings\">索引设置</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "It is possible to define multiple fields to be highlighted like above, and both the <code>@Highlight</code> and the <code>@HighlightField</code> annotation can further be customized with a <code>@HighlightParameters</code> annotation. Check the Javadocs for the possible configuration options.",
      "translation": "可以像上面那样定义多个需要高亮的字段，并且可以通过 `@HighlightParameters` 注解进一步自定义 `<code>@Highlight</code>` 和 `<code>@HighlightField</code>` 注解。请查阅 Javadocs 以了解可能的配置选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Using the <code>Transport Client</code> or <code>Rest Client</code> element registers an instance of <code>Elasticsearch Server</code> in the context.",
      "translation": "使用<code>Transport Client</code>或<code>Rest Client</code>元素可在上下文中注册一个<code>Elasticsearch Server</code>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>@Highlight</code> annotation on a repository method defines for which fields of the returned entity highlighting should be included.To search for some text in a <code>Book</code> 's name or summary and have the found data highlighted, the following repository method can be used:",
      "translation": "实体返回方法上的 `<code>@Highlight</code>` 注解定义了应在返回实体的哪些字段中包含高亮内容。若要搜索 `<code>Book</code>` 的名称或摘要中的某些文本，并对找到的数据进行高亮显示，可以使用以下存储库方法：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When working with <code>Query</code> implementations and the <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> this is easily possible by setting a\nsource filter on the query.",
      "translation": "在使用 `<code>Query`</code> 实现和 `<code>ElasticsearchOperations`</code> 时，只需在查询中设置源过滤器即可轻松实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In this example, all the properties of the returned <code>Book</code> objects would be <code>null</code> except the name.",
      "translation": "在此示例中，返回的<code>Book</code>对象的所有属性均为<code>null</code>，除了名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Using the <code>repositories</code> element looks up Spring Data repositories as described in <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../../repositories/create-instances.html\">Creating Repository Instances</a>.",
      "translation": "使用 `<code>repositories</code>` 元素可按照<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../../repositories/create-instances.html\">创建存储库实例</a>中的描述查找 Spring Data 存储库。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In the search results the highlight data can be retrieved from the <code>SearchHit</code> class.",
      "translation": "在搜索结果中，高亮数据可以从 <code>SearchHit</code> 类中获取。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When using repository methods there is the <code>@SourceFilters</code> annotation:",
      "translation": "在使用仓储方法时，存在 `<code>@SourceFilters</code>` 注解：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Spring Data Elasticsearch module contains a custom namespace allowing definition of repository beans as well as elements for instantiating a <code>ElasticsearchServer</code> .",
      "translation": "Spring Data Elasticsearch 模块包含一个自定义命名空间，允许定义存储库 Bean 以及用于实例化 <code>ElasticsearchServer</code> 的元素。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This chapter includes details of the Elasticsearch repository implementation.",
      "translation": "本章包含 Elasticsearch 仓库实现的详细信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sometimes the user does not need to have all the properties of an entity returned from a search but only a subset.\nElasticsearch provides source filtering to reduce the amount of data that is transferred across the network to the\napplication.",
      "translation": "有时用户并不需要从搜索中返回实体的所有属性，而只需要其中一部分。Elasticsearch 提供了源过滤功能，以减少通过网络传输到应用程序的数据量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Spring Data Elasticsearch repositories support can be activated using an annotation through JavaConfig.",
      "translation": "可以通过 JavaConfig 中的注解来激活 Spring Data Elasticsearch 存储库支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
