    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>The <code>EnableElasticsearchRepositories</code> annotation activates the Repository support.\nIf no base package is configured, it will use the one of the configuration class it is put on.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Provide a Bean named <code>elasticsearchTemplate</code> of type <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> by using one of the configurations shown in the <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../template.html\">Elasticsearch Operations</a> chapter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>Let Spring inject the Repository bean into your class.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td><code>EnableElasticsearchRepositories</code> 注解用于激活 Repository 支持。如果未配置基础包，它将使用该注解所在配置类的基础包。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>通过<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../template.html\">Elasticsearch 操作</a>章节中所示的任一配置方式，提供一个类型为 <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> 且名为 <code>elasticsearchTemplate</code> 的 Bean。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>让 Spring 将 Repository Bean 注入到您的类中。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
